'' Collection initialisers (a tiko extension), refused: a type that needs construction but
'' has no Add, PushBack or Push (TKO0843, where the list used to be dropped in silence); a
'' shared or namespace variable (TKO0844, not yet); and the elements' own errors, which are
'' the ordinary ones for the synthesised calls -- arity and conversion, at the element. A
'' plain-data type with a Push method is not a collection and is untouched.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/diagnostics/src/collinit-errors.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(11,18): error TKO0843: 'z' cannot take an initializer list: its type has no Add, PushBack or Push method
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(15,43): error TKO0844: an initializer list on 'sh' is not supported yet
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(17,40): error TKO0844: an initializer list on 'nv' is not supported yet
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(21,37): error TKO0775: this call passes 2 argument(s), but 'push' takes 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: collinit-errors.bas(22,40): error TKO0698: this argument does not convert to the parameter's type
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 5
